Algorithm 2: Earliest finish time of J_X after state v_p
Input : Job set J_X, system state v_p
Output: Earliest finish time EF_T(J_X, v_p)
1 Sort J_X by r_min ascending, break ties by highest p;
2 EF_T_val = A_min_1;
3 FOR J_k IN J_X:
4   EF_T_val = max(EF_T_val, J_k.r_min) + J_k.C_min;
5 RETURN EF_T_val;

